Ghost Kali

Powered by official Kali Linux upstream sources.

This project is built around the official Kali Linux ecosystem and is intended to remain aligned with the official Kali package repositories, licensing requirements, and upstream source model.

Key upstream references:
- Kali Linux: https://www.kali.org/
- Kali docs: https://www.kali.org/docs/
- Kali NetHunter: https://www.kali.org/get-kali/#kali-mobile

Important notice:
- Ghost Kali is a Kali-derived custom build project.
- It does not replace the official Kali Linux project.
- It does not replace the official Kali NetHunter project.
- It keeps the official Kali notices, source relationships, and licensing obligations visible.

When redistributing derivative builds, preserve the relevant upstream license files, copyright notices, and source-access information.

This repository is for authorized security testing, education, and legitimate system administration use only.
